<title>USA: Virginia $225 mln housing deal won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Virginia $225 mln housing deal won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Tuesday it won $225 million Virginia Housing Development Authority series A bonds at a true interest cost of 5.909 percent.</p>
</text>
